{"id":"mensaje","lemma":"mensaje","pos":"noun","rank":474,"glosses":["message","speech"],"ipa":"/menˈsaxe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"mensajes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mensaje.wav","formAudio":{"mensajes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Txtdgtl-mensajes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál es el mensaje?","en":"What's the message?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501658"},{"text":"No me mandes mensajes.","en":"Don't send me messages.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/833123"},{"text":"Te dejé un mensaje.","en":"I left you a message.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454153"},{"text":"¿Hay mensajes para mí?","en":"Are there any messages for me?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585706"},{"text":"¿Puedo tomar su mensaje?","en":"May I take a message?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501422"}]}